Negative control for filter-clear.test.ts.

Mounts and unmounts the search box's clear with the term instead of keeping it
mounted and merely hidden, so the box re-widths on the first and last keystroke.
The assertion that the clear is present-but-out-of-sight while the leaf is unset
goes red; every assertion about what the clear WRITES, and the name it announces,
stays green — the semantics are untouched.

